  "ruleText": "Mec 102.21 “Point of delivery” means the outlet of the natural gas meter or first stage liquefied propane regulator.\n\nSource. #10798, eff 3-18-15; ss by #13483, eff 1-9-23 (formerly Saf-Mec 102.16) (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Mec 100); #14408, eff 10-17-25",
